  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparing the Sustainable Road Infrastructure Investment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project readiness financing (PRF) is intended to test the project approach and prepare an investment project suitable for Asian Development Bank&amp;apos;s (ADB) financing programmed in 2023. It will prepare the ensuing investment project by: (i) screening suitable road section for piloting the advanced construction technology and subsequent selection of candidate subprojects for the ensuing investment project(s); (ii) undertaking feasibility studies and due diligence on institutional, financial, procurement, and safeguards aspects of the selected subprojects; (iii) preparing detailed engineering designs and procurement of contracts for the ensuing project, including preparation of bid documents and procurement management support; and (iv) initial capacity building to support the ensuing project&amp;apos;s start-up activities.</narrative>
  </description>
